---
<Base
  title="Qerko a Septim: QR platby u stolu | Septim"
  description="Qerko a pokladní systém Septim přinášejí platby QR kódem přímo u stolu. Zrychlete obsluhu a nabídněte hostům moderní platbu."
  path="/partneri/qerko"
  bodyClass="use-header-transparent use-menu-primary-uppercase use-menu-secondary-uppercase use-headings-link-plain search-panel-hide-submit-label search-panel-hide-close-label search-panel-hide-open-label use-menu-bar use-header-fixed use-header-fixed-mobile use-header-priority"
  image="/files/nahled-septim-qerko.jpg"
>
<div class="section height--normal align--middle color--default section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h1>Qerko<span class="text-highlight">:</span> partner systému Septim</h1>
<p class="text-large">Qerko je mladá společnost s velkým růstem. Zajišťuje platby přes QR kód od stolu v restauracích.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="section-background container-fit container-fit--cover" style="background-color:rgb(235, 252, 255)"><img alt="" decoding="async" sizes="(orientation: portrait) 416.47vw, 100vw" src="/files/r/1280/hdr-tapeta-septim-qerko-blue.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/hdr-tapeta-septim-qerko-blue.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/hdr-tapeta-septim-qerko-blue.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/hdr-tapeta-septim-qerko-blue.webp 1920w" style="object-position:50% 0%"/></div></div>
